{"ref":"BDB, שָׂעִיר","hw":"שָׂעִיר","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂעִיר</span></big><sub>53</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong><a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:24\" href=\"/Numbers.15.24\">Nu 15:24</a> <strong>he-goat, buck (</strong><em>hairy</em> one; NH id.<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.24\">Lv 4:24</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:16\" href=\"/Numbers.7.16\">Nu 7:16</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעִירִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.7\">Lv 16:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.8\">8</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעִירֵי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:87\" href=\"/Numbers.7.87\">Nu 7:87</a>;—<em>he-goat</em>, usually <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעִיר(־)עִזִּים</span> <em>buck of goats</em> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֵז\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵז\", dir=\"rtl\">עֵז</a> p. 777): <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:31\" href=\"/Genesis.37.31\">Gn 37:31</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.22\">Ez 43:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.23\">45:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.23\">Lv 4:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.3\">9:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.19\">23:19</a> + 20 times Nu (all P); <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעִירֵי ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.5\">Lv 16:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:87\" href=\"/Numbers.7.87\">Nu 7:87</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> alone = <em>he-goat</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.24\">Lv 4:24</a> + 11 times <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16\" href=\"/Leviticus.16\">Lv 16</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעִיר (הַ)חַטָּאת</span> <em>he-goat for sin-offering</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.25\">Ez 43:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.15\">L